<Layout title="Logdis Middleware - Mas Muhammad" description="A last-mile delivery dispatch system built with C# (.NET Core 3.1). Bridges ERP order data (iSMS/AYO) to last-mile logistics platforms (LOCUS), manages delivery notes, customer master data, vehicle fleet, and provides real-time task tracking with cron-scheduled background workers.">
  <Nav variant="subpage" backHref="/portfolio" backText="Back to Portfolio" />

  <div class="cs-page">

<header class="cs-hero">
<div class="cs-hero-meta">
<span class="cs-badge cs-badge-corporate">Corporate</span><span class="cs-badge cs-badge-client">Sampoerna</span> 
<span class="cs-badge cs-badge-year">April 2023</span>
</div>
<h1 class="cs-hero-title">Logdis <span>Middleware</span><span class="cs-cursor"></span></h1>
<p class="cs-hero-desc">
A last-mile delivery dispatch system built with C# (.NET Core 3.1). Bridges ERP order data (iSMS/AYO) to last-mile logistics platforms (LOCUS), manages delivery notes, customer master data, vehicle fleet, and provides real-time task tracking with cron-scheduled background workers.
</p>
<div class="cs-stack-pills">
<span class="cs-stack-pill">C# .NET Core 3.1</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">ASP.NET Core</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">SQL Server</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">MongoDB</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">KendoUI</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">KnockoutJS</span>
<span class="cs-stack-pill">Docker</span>
</div>
